08:48.940 --> 08:52.290
See? The Freeze Time is only six seconds.

08:52.290 --> 08:57.100
My movement value is also 6, 
so it must just use the same number, I guess.

08:55.760 --> 08:57.090
Movement Value

08:57.100 --> 09:01.360
It'd be pretty tough if that kicked in 
when you were in the middle of a battle.

09:01.360 --> 09:05.540
But then I can get Hiroto-kun
 to protect me, right?

09:06.330 --> 09:08.350
One more basic thing.

09:08.360 --> 09:14.530
Team
Slot

09:08.360 --> 09:14.530
Ability

